com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Force_(material)\" title=\"Force (material)\">Force</a>:</b> <b>Force</b> items are formed from magical energy. These items are often semi-incorporeal; weapons made from force often have <a href=\"/page/Ghost_Touch\" title=\"Ghost Touch\">Ghost Touch</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0012350000</span>12,350<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a></b>, Disc locked optional end chest&#160;; <br /> Chance on every 3rd completion of <a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: V</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Force_Shot\" title=\"Force Shot\">Force Shot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance to terrorizing foes that hit you, applying a Mind Thrust effect, when you are hit by them (dealing 5d8 force damage, Will save vs. Enchantments negates). It may also expose your foes to their greatest fears, acting as a Phantasmal Killer spell.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +48</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +48</a>:</b> Passive: +48 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore VI</a>:</b> Passive: All of your spells gain a 6% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mind_Drain\" title=\"Mind Drain\">Mind Drain</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mind_Drain\" title=\"Mind Drain\">Mind Drain</a>:</b> This item reduces your maximum spell points by 5% while equipped.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\"> Will Save -2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\"> Will Save -2</a>:</b> This item gives a -2 penalty to your Will saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force IV<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force IV: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d6 points of force damage per hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Craftable_Rune_Arm\" title=\"Craftable Rune Arm\">Craftable Rune Arm</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Rune Arm is craftable and can be customized using recipes at standard crafting devices after disjuncting.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/edit/Mind_Drain_and_Will_save_-2_is_removed?redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mind Drain and Will save -2 is removed (page does not exist)\">Mind Drain and Will save -2 is removed</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>You hear the faint whispers of infinite possibilities while wearing this rune arm. I'm sure it's just your imagination.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>If you have a <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(enchantment)\" title=\"True Seeing (enchantment)\">True Seeing</a> effect you can see the <a href=\"/page/Quori\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quori\">Quori</a> creature attached to your rune arm. The name come from a certain song that’s a meme. It’s on the tip of my tongue.....\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:QuoriOnLucidDreams.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/QuoriOnLucidDreams.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"339\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>This is the item as it appears after being disjuncted at a Essence Crafting station and prepared for crafting:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lucid_Dreams_disjuncted.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lucid_Dreams_disjuncted.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"438\" height=\"735\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lucid_Dreams.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Lucid_Dreams.png/420px-Lucid_Dreams.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"760\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lucid_Dreams.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816235309\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.146 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5597/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3774